@ConferenceRoomBookingAPIv3_HostAddress = https://localhost:32771
@roomId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List rooms
GET {{ConferenceRoomBookingAPIv3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Find available rooms
GET {{ConferenceRoomBookingAPIv3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/available?startsAt=2026-09-01T10:00:00%2B03:00&endsAt=2026-09-01T14:00:00%2B03:00&capacity=50
Accept: application/json

### Add a room
POST {{ConferenceRoomBookingAPIv3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Зал D",
  "capacity": 25,
  "baseHourlyRate": 1800,
  "services": [
    { "name": "Проектор", "price": 500 },
    { "name": "Wi-Fi", "price": 300 }
  ]
}

### Book a room
POST {{ConferenceRoomBookingAPIv3_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-09-01T18:00:00+03:00",
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "serviceIds": []
}
